%% Raccoon docs/15 序列图：monitor sampler 生命周期 / stats 查询链路 / 前端轮询生命周期
sequenceDiagram
    participant M as main
    participant S as Server
    participant SP as monitor.Sampler
    participant PR as proc(linux)
    participant RB as RingBuffer
    participant DB as SQLite

    M->>S: New(cfg, store, logger)
    S->>SP: monitor.New(store, 2s, ringCap=60)
    S->>SP: Start(ctx)
    loop 每 2s（ticker）
        SP->>PR: read /proc/stat|meminfo|net/dev
        PR-->>SP: Sample{...}
        SP->>SP: cpuUsagePct(prev, cur) / bps delta
        SP->>RB: push(cpu, memory, net_up, net_down)
        Note over SP: 满 30 tick（60s）且平台为 linux
        SP->>SP: aggregate(30 样本) → 1min 均值
        SP->>DB: UPSERT monitor_sample(ts,...)
        SP->>DB: DELETE FROM monitor_sample WHERE ts < now-7d
    end
    Note over S: 优雅停机（/system/restart 或 SIGTERM）
    S->>SP: Stop()
    alt 聚合器已有 ≥1 样本
        SP->>DB: flush 部分 1min 聚合（诚实：不丢已采样本）
    end
    SP-->>S: stopped
sequenceDiagram
    participant OV as Overview.vue
    participant SS as stores/system.ts
    participant API as api/client.ts
    participant H as stats_handler.go
    participant ST as store/stats.go
    participant DB as SQLite

    OV->>SS: onMounted → system.startSummary()
    SS->>API: GET /system/stats/summary
    API->>H: requireAuth → handleSummary
    H->>ST: SummaryStats(uptimeSec)
    ST->>DB: COUNT(done, finished_at BETWEEN 今日0点 AND 明日0点)
    ST->>DB: COUNT(done, finished_at BETWEEN 本周一0点 AND 下周一0点)
    ST->>DB: SELECT kind, COUNT(*) FROM media_files GROUP BY kind
    ST->>DB: JOIN subscriptions(source_type='favorite')
    ST->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM live_sources WHERE status='recording'
    DB-->>ST: rows
    ST-->>H: SummaryStats（SuccessRate 分母 0 = nil）
    H-->>SS: 200 JSON
    SS-->>OV: ref 更新 → MetricCard 渲染（success_rate=null → 「—」）
    Note over SS: 5s 轮询；页面不可见或离开即停（见 4.3）
sequenceDiagram
    participant V as Monitor.vue
    participant SS as stores/system.ts
    participant API as api/client.ts
    participant AU as stores/auth.ts
    participant AP as App.vue

    V->>SS: onMounted → system.connect('monitor')
    SS->>API: monitorNow() 立即拉一次
    SS->>SS: setInterval(2s)
    loop 可见且已连接
        SS->>API: monitorNow()
    end
    Note over SS: document visibilitychange
    alt 页面隐藏
        SS->>SS: clearInterval（停轮询，省电省流量）
    else 页面恢复可见
        SS->>API: 立即拉一次
        SS->>SS: setInterval(2s) 恢复
    end
    V->>SS: onUnmounted → system.disconnect('monitor')
    Note over AP: auth.phase 离开 ready（登出/掉线）
    AP->>SS: system.disconnectAll()
    Note over SS: 401/403 → auth.markUnauthenticated()（同 tasks store 语义）
    Note over SS: 请求失败 → error ref + 指数退避重试（1/2/5s，最多 3 次后停下一次 tick）
